stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OPEN
    
    OPEN --> ACTIVE : answerSubmitted()
    OPEN --> CLOSED : closedByAuthor()
    
    ACTIVE --> RESOLVED : answerAccepted()
    ACTIVE --> CLOSED : closedByAuthor()
    ACTIVE --> OPEN : allAnswersDeleted()
    
    RESOLVED --> CLOSED : closedByAuthor()
    
    CLOSED --> [*]
    
    note right of OPEN
        New thread awaiting responses.
        Visible to matched experts.
    end note
    
    note right of ACTIVE
        Has at least one answer.
        Discussion ongoing.
    end note
    
    note right of RESOLVED
        Author accepted an answer.
        Can still receive new answers.
    end note
    
    note right of CLOSED
        Thread locked, no new answers.
        Archived for reference.
    end note
